# Waking the Beast (battlefield.waking_the_beast_fullmoon, FullMoonFountain): the exit. The char (level 99 Warrior, the
# quest accepted, the seven key items) enters area 1, then Moon_Spiral in the battlefield: 32003; its update: nothing;
# finished with 0: still inside. The main Carbuncle killed to 1 HP; Moon_Spiral again, finished with 4: out; the
# battlefield's effect gone.
lists FullMoonFountain/MS_Entrance/onTrigger FullMoonFountain/Moon_Spiral/onTrigger FullMoonFountain/onEventUpdate/32003 FullMoonFountain/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=FullMoonFountain pos=-301.8,9.5,-260.1 job=WAR lvl=99
quest OtherAreas.WakingTheBeast accepted
keyitem EyeOfFlames
keyitem EyeOfFrost
keyitem EyeOfGales
keyitem EyeOfStorms
keyitem EyeOfTides
keyitem EyeOfTremors
keyitem RainbowResonator
login
trigger MS_Entrance
update 32000 option=33
finish
trigger Moon_Spiral
update 32003 option=1                   # nothing
finish option=0                         # 0: still inside
tick 2000
kill CARBUNCLE_PRIME                    # unkillable: killed to 1 HP
trigger Moon_Spiral
finish option=4                         # 4: out of the battlefield
tick 1000
tick 8000
tick 10000
